            "type": "table",
            "anchor": null,
            "rows": [
                {
                    "row": 0,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2. The following was identified as a result of the inspection:",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": true,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 1,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.1 Remarks on the accompanying documentation (none, or give comments): 1. The requirement of subsection 4.6 of the Technical Specification has been violated: the supplied products are not marked. / Нарушено требование подраздела 4.6 Технического задания: отсутствует маркировка поставленной продукции.2. The provided quality document (Certificate (KKS 93UXX00AB011)) contains discrepancies regarding the presence of a threshold in the door unit. / В предоставленном документе о качестве (Паспорт (KKS 93UXX00AB011)), выявлены разночтения в части наличия, в дверном блоке, порога.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 2,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.2. Remarks for visual, measurement and other inspections including Materials completeness (none, or give comments): 1. The requirements regarding the completeness as specified in Appendix No. 1 of the Technical Specification have been violated / Нарушены требования в части комплектности Приложение No1 Технического задания: The lock (which opens from the outside with a key and from the inside without a key) is missing (items 1, 2, 4) / Отсутствуют замки (открывающийся снаружи ключом, изнутри без ключа) (позиция 1, 2, 4); The door closer is missing (items 1, 2, 3, 4) / Отсутствует доводчик (позиции 1, 2, 3, 4).The delivered internal door unit made of PVC profiles, DPV G Bpr Op Pr R 1000-2300 (KKS 93UXX00AB011), was actually delivered with a threshold, in accordance with project ED.D.N000.9.3UXX&&&&&&&&.011.DC.0001.E-CDM0003, as well as the Technical Specification and the Supply Agreement; there is no threshold. / Поставленный Дверной блок из ПВХ-профилей внутренний ДПВ Г Бпр Оп Пр Р 1000-2300 (KKS 93UXX00AB011) фактически поставлен с порогом, согласно проекта ED.D.N000.9.3UXX&&&&&&&&.011.DC.0001.E-CDM0003, а также Технического задания и Договора поставки, порог отсутствует.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 3,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.3. Remarks for preservation and/or anticorrosive coating (none, or give comments): NONE",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 4,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.4. Nonconformities (none, or give comments, Nonconformity Report no.): NONE",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
